---
title: Failover Import - Full vs Incremental
---
flowchart TD
    A["Failover triggered<br/>WEST now writable"] --> B["Read _latest.txt + bundles from S3"]
    B --> C{"WEST registry state at failover?"}
    C -->|"empty - 1st failover, or standby was reset"| FULL["FULL import<br/>experiments to runs to versions to aliases to grants"]
    C -->|"still holds prior import"| INCR["INCREMENTAL import<br/>skip versions already present,<br/>move only new versions + drifted metadata"]
    FULL --> P["Promote: set dr_state = west<br/>verify flip + repoint consumers"]
    INCR --> P

    classDef full fill:#e8eaf6,stroke:#3949ab,color:#1a237e;
    classDef incr fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#137333,color:#0b3d1f;
    class FULL full;
    class INCR incr;
